# ============================================================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS FOR PRODUCTION
# ============================================================================
#
# 1. DATABASE_URL: Create PostgreSQL on Bluehost (cPanel > MySQL/PostgreSQL Databases)
#    Format: postgresql://username:password@host:port/database_name
#
# 2. NEXTAUTH_SECRET: Generate with: openssl rand -base64 32
#    IMPORTANT: Must be exactly 32 characters minimum
#
# 3. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL: Set to your domain
#    Example: https://consol.yourdomain.com/api
#
# 4. CLOUDINARY: Sign up at https://cloudinary.com (free tier available)
#    Then get credentials from Dashboard
#
# NEVER commit this file with real secrets!
# For production, set these in your Bluehost environment or .env.production